# Phase 1: Ideation

## Project Name
LegalEase - AI Powered Legal Document Generator

## Problem Statement
Creating legal documents manually takes time and may require expensive legal assistance.

## Proposed Solution
LegalEase uses AI to generate draft legal documents in simple language.

## Objectives
- Generate legal document drafts.
- Support common document types.
- Reduce manual drafting time.
- Provide a simple user interface.

## Target Users
Students, individuals, small businesses and startups.

## Expected Outcome
A simple AI-powered legal document generation application.

